{"2879750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vagrant Moon", "steam_appid": 2879750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world of moon and cloud, uncover hidden secrets, and enjoy classic platforming in a modern tribute to the golden age of 3D platformers built around player-led exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagrant Moon is a focused, exploration-driven 3D platformer inspired by the charm and clarity of classic 3D platforming adventures. It is made for players who miss the satisfaction of pure discovery without hand-holding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no constant prompts. You discover the way forward through observation, exploration, and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for secrets, grow stronger through meaningful upgrades, and carve your own route through a tranquil world where curiosity is always rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat pressure. Just deduction, discovery, and classic platforming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 🌕 <i><strong>Why Players Enjoy Vagrant Moon</strong> </i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Non-linear World Meant to Be Wandered</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move at your own pace through a calm, atmospheric landscape free of adversaries, with open exploration, hidden secrets, and new heights unlocked through crystal-powered upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Player-led Exploration</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the world, follow visual clues, and use deduction to find your way onward. Curiosity is rewarded.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Progress That Matters</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect crystals to enhance your abilities and reach places that were once unreachable. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classic Platforming Feel</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, classic 3D platformer feel with simple mechanics, satisfying movement, and well-tuned platforming sections.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <i><strong>Designed with Intent</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer with a love for classic platformers, Vagrant Moon respects your intelligence: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No artificial padding </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No overwhelming UI </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No endless tutorials or hand-holding</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player agency: deduce your way forward and discover things for yourself</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just thoughtful level design and the quiet satisfaction of discovery and deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you long for the feeling of classic 3D adventures, where exploration itself was the reward, your journey begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879750/extras/c3426e5dd55b13dc82539cd71c2df104.avif?t=1770185289\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Can you find thy way to Vagrant Moon, resting gently where the high clouds bloom?&quot;</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world of moon and cloud, uncover hidden secrets, and enjoy classic platforming in a modern tribute to the golden age of 3D platformers built around player-led exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagrant Moon is a focused, exploration-driven 3D platformer inspired by the charm and clarity of classic 3D platforming adventures. It is made for players who miss the satisfaction of pure discovery without hand-holding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no constant prompts. You discover the way forward through observation, exploration, and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for secrets, grow stronger through meaningful upgrades, and carve your own route through a tranquil world where curiosity is always rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat pressure. Just deduction, discovery, and classic platforming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 🌕 <i><strong>Why Players Enjoy Vagrant Moon</strong> </i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Non-linear World Meant to Be Wandered</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move at your own pace through a calm, atmospheric landscape free of adversaries, with open exploration, hidden secrets, and new heights unlocked through crystal-powered upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Player-led Exploration</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the world, follow visual clues, and use deduction to find your way onward. Curiosity is rewarded.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Progress That Matters</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect crystals to enhance your abilities and reach places that were once unreachable. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classic Platforming Feel</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, classic 3D platformer feel with simple mechanics, satisfying movement, and well-tuned platforming sections.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <i><strong>Designed with Intent</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer with a love for classic platformers, Vagrant Moon respects your intelligence: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No artificial padding </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No overwhelming UI </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No endless 